eternalforest-by-soulman (1.0-0ddebs3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Changes prepared with Claude Opus 5.5
  * debian/patches/01_update-makefile.patch : use the build flags of the
    environment for the debug executable (hardening), fixed the clean
    target, DEP-3 header
  * debian/patches/02_change-data-path.patch : load the installed shader
    directly, no more unifdef run in a gen/ directory of the current
    directory at start-up, removed the shader file monitor
  * debian/patches/03_quit-on-window-close.patch : stop the program when
    the window is closed
  * debian/control : removed unused build dependencies (shader-minifier,
    unifdef) and the dependency on common-install-function-ddebs, added
    libgl-dev, Pouet Homepage, rewritten description
  * debian/rules : hardening=+all
  * debian/install : install the shader as fshader.glsl
  * debian/resources : added the missing icon (made from preview.png)
  * debian/eternalforest-by-soulman.6.md : rewritten, no --help option
  * debian/README.Debian : rewritten
  * debian/copyright : filled Upstream-Contact
  * debian/upstream/metadata : added, replaces metadata.ex
  * debian/eternalforest-by-soulman.lintian-overrides : override for the
    pandoc manual page
  * debian/resources/eternalforest-by-soulman.desktop : added Keywords

